Level 5 → 6

Goal: Find a file in inhere that is human-readable, exactly 1033 bytes, and not executable.

find . -type f -size 1033c ! -executable
The c suffix means bytes. Without it, find counts in 512-byte blocks.
The file is hidden inside a subdirectory, so cat it using the full path find printed (e.g. ./maybehere07/.file2)

