Level 6 → 7

Goal: Find a file somewhere on the server owned by user bandit7, group bandit6, 33 bytes.

find / -user bandit7 -group bandit6 -size 33c 2>/dev/null
Searching from / produces loads of “Permission denied” errors. 2>/dev/null sends error output (stream 2) to nowhere, which fixes the junk problem you noted.
The result is /var/lib/dpkg/info/bandit7.password, then cat it.

