Level 7 → 8

Goal: The password is next to the word “millionth” in data.txt.

grep 'millionth' data.txt prints only the lines containing that word, so you don’t have to scroll through a huge file
Useful grep flags to remember: -i (ignore case), -n (line numbers), -r (search recursively through directories)

